-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--         FILE:  luaotfload-configuration.lua
--  DESCRIPTION:  part of luaotfload / luaotfload-tool / config file reader
--       AUTHOR:  Philipp Gesang, <phg@phi-gamma.net>
--       AUTHOR:  Dohyun Kim <nomosnomos@gmail.com>
