---
---* Corresponding C source code: [ltexlib.c#L1714-1813](https://gitlab.lisn.upsaclay.fr/texlive/luatex/-/blob/80a00d7131ae569d4a49f374e988226fe20de0d3/source/texk/web2c/luatexdir/lua/ltexlib.c#L1714-1813)
