---* Source file of the `LuaTeX` manual: [luatex-tex.tex#L1395-L1396](https://gitlab.lisn.upsaclay.fr/texlive/luatex/-/blob/f52b099f3e01d53dc03b315e1909245c3d5418d3/manual/luatex-tex.tex#L1395-L1396)
