---😱 [Types](https://github.com/Josef-Friedrich/LuaTeX_Lua-API/blob/main/library/luatex/status.lua) incomplete or incorrect? 🙏 [Please contribute!](https://github.com/Josef-Friedrich/LuaTeX_Lua-API/pulls)
