---@alias PdfLiteralModes
---|0 `origin`
---|1 `page`
---|2 `direct`
---|3 `raw`
---|4 `text`
---|5 `font`
---|6 `special`

---
---The higher the number, the less checking and the more you can run into trouble.
---Especially the `raw` variant can produce bad *PDF* so you can best check
---what you generate.
---
