---* Corresponding C source code: [pdfgen.c#L1788](https://gitlab.lisn.upsaclay.fr/texlive/luatex/-/blob/f52b099f3e01d53dc03b315e1909245c3d5418d3/source/texk/web2c/luatexdir/pdf/pdfgen.c#L1788)
